        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Just picked this up and think I got the rules down (haven&#39;t played it yet) but the only question I have is what happens when a character gets incapped during its power phase? Does it just reroll and continue or does it &quot;skip&quot; his turn. Rules say replace health and reroll and thats it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 475,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
