        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>In what scenario would a character be incaped during the actual Power Up phase? If this is your question, then fear not since it&#39;s not possible.</p><p>Do you mean what happens when an already incaped character gets to their Power Up phase? If so, they get up, reroll movement for that turn, replace 1 power card (you should only have one at this point since all cards were removed when you were incaped) and restore all health. It explicitly states this very thing in the rule book under the Power Up phase.</p><p>Am I understanding your question correctly?</p>",
