        "raw": "<p>No problem. Happy to help.</p><p>As a side note, keep ears and eyes out for the expansion we are currently working on. The game is going through a bit of a rework and tweeking/streamlining from what we all have now. So if you enjoy the game as is as much as the rest of us, stick around for news about Prime War!</p>",
