      {
        "id": 191597,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-10T20:04:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Do you mean incapped when using Actions?</p><p>Like incapped moving through Hazard spaces, triggering Ambuscade's bombs or something like that?</p><p>In those cases your turn ends when you are incapped and you will recover at the start of your next turn. &nbsp;During Power-up, when you recover from incapacitation you aren't entering the space, your hero is already there, so nothing will trigger off of that that could deal you damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:18:12.108Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
