        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Do you mean incapped when using Actions?</p><p>Like incapped moving through Hazard spaces, triggering Ambuscade&#39;s bombs or something like that?</p><p>In those cases your turn ends when you are incapped and you will recover at the start of your next turn. &nbsp;During Power-up, when you recover from incapacitation you aren&#39;t entering the space, your hero is already there, so nothing will trigger off of that that could deal you damage.</p>",
